q=A.u('Welcome to Avinex Escrow ("Avinex", "we", "our", "us"). These Terms of Service govern your access to and use of our platform. By using Avinex, you agree to be legally bound by these Terms.',e8,e8,e8,e8,B.aT,e8,e8)
p=A.u("1. Nature of Service",e8,e8,e8,e8,B.bb,e8,e8)
o=A.u("Avinex Escrow provides a digital escrow service that: holds funds on behalf of transacting parties; releases funds upon fulfillment of agreed conditions; and facilitates dispute resolution between users. Avinex is not a marketplace, but an intermediary platform.",e8,e8,e8,e8,B.aT,e8,e8)
n=A.u("2. Eligibility",e8,e8,e8,e8,B.bb,e8,e8)
