k=A.u("You agree to maintain confidentiality of your account credentials, be responsible for all activities under your account, and notify us immediately of any unauthorized access. Avinex may suspend or terminate accounts for fraudulent activity, misrepresentation, or violation of these Terms.",e8,e8,e8,e8,B.aT,e8,e8)
j=A.u("4. Escrow Transactions",e8,e8,e8,e8,B.bb,e8,e8)
